RULE 1 (ucinewgame ordering), go depth 10 on a Ruy Lopez position:
  position, then ucinewgame : d2d4
  ucinewgame, then position : b1c3
  position alone            : b1c3
  startpos alone            : d2d4
  P1 position-then-ucinewgame differs from position alone: True
  P2 ucinewgame-then-position equals position alone       : True
